    "identifier": "ASCII maximal identifier; contextual keywords retain their spelling and are still permitted by Identifier.",
    "number": "u128 magnitude; payload bounds are checked during typed lowering.",
    "EOF": "EOF is lookahead only and excluded from the derivation frontier."
  },
